desc:
Welcome to Granny! This is game is an adaptation of Granny by DVloper

Survivor: Find items, solve puzzles, and escape before Granny catches you. Stay alert and avoid traps!
Granny: Hunt down all survivors and capture them. Set traps to control the map and win the game!

🔮 The game will soon be completely reworked
🎟️ Promo codes are posted in our community server and our X page.
🏘️ New maps and map redesigns coming soon...

